#: badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c01478334fed718d2de993ebae3abf7125727f5aec16a536f234d7a4bf16eef4
#. default-sha256: d3edf9237bf97db4908d8679fa5ceb3a97495b520854b668bad14dedd1af0693
msgctxt "badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫She was absolutely right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫――시녀의 말은 ⟪k:19⟫옳다."

#: badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c71f7b695d0b6be8aa9a886144aff95f93604ad51d6f93b81a35858a113310f
#. default-sha256: eb75ee05159abf81be7413e84a205fadd167ae620c95237a23c668ef376f1fc9
msgctxt "badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had seen an excess of tragedy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」은⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:4⟫ 현재에 이르기까지 ⟪k:5⟫몹시 많은 비극을 보았다."

#: badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95556951a587d73d3fa7b2240a72d3621a6a5ed034492276d4cd9d6c2f6a4b7e
#. default-sha256: 55a556cd1f29167f1b0c91b0234a25b39dd54b491f6cb53d0ba97d3572c6a295
msgctxt "badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had borne witness to far too much pain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫몹시 많은 ⟪k:1⟫마음의 고통을 보았다."

#: badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f467aee38b7ca74822ef31b459c0ec1ef0e40780d46e97d4a7366986ddb36a5
#. default-sha256: 3eb82c15314a3dc7557984e168ee599f102efd76e58a01f6dbe878aa703663c5
msgctxt "badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫ spirit was deeply wounded by it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:4⟫의 마음은 치명적인 상처를 입었다……."

#: badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60e8f08f7480d5df95fb01f4ac96c53fd43297937b10b16c6b5234bca4d7b385
#. default-sha256: aaa8dd13a5430a7dbcfbf63cc06dc8087515a2559d010facc9bd7fbc0a73fe27
msgctxt "badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ could not possibly endure any further tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이보다 더한 비극은 ⟪k:1⟫차마 견딜 수 없었다."

#: badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 202febbc6590f53de462923678d6c5f7d386ba16351e4babff06312060184571
#. default-sha256: b480aa7f4f2445e67166394407967cc85d721360bb000fff1f9d7d302f02d5ea
msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러니…… ⟪k:1⟫시녀가 지켜 주겠다면, ⟪k:2⟫이를 따르는 게 옳을 것이다."

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff1366158d90f65fac431377cb2c1b1fb68ba20665ad6883093592dc1fe66699
#. default-sha256: fc6d00e50acaa8cac94d67213149b30c7e178d1073c46ae20bcd5e869ce7f83b
msgctxt "badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had guided ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ this far, never letting go of ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫시녀는 여기까지 ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「당신」을⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「죽은 자」를⟪k:5⟫ 이끌어 주었다."

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7ae8b47abc78cb0d8eaa1a15c55c5dae9a3dc723777c0566da832cba7a1febb
#. default-sha256: e3c1acfb1e311d426b69cec2ee2f0e6694fa853c8b62dae7efa9202a9edbb817
msgctxt "badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it was her presence that had allowed ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ to bear the bleak, "
"disheartening, and wretched tales ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫he⟪k:6⟫ saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫때로는 우울하며, ⟪k:1⟫때로는 음산하며, ⟪k:2⟫때로는 잔혹한 이야기가 펼쳐졌을 때도, ⟪k:3⟫시녀"
"가 손을 잡아 주었기에 ⟪k:4⟫여기까지 올 수 있었으리라."

#: badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50a54a4020d33cf3bbe3dbabda91a752b62056e37bc7c33d2077797242de6518
#. default-sha256: 17cd750bac98ad734e38f767b576d8e6bc8c6ce88c414147827416878d067a9a
msgctxt "badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ really need anything other than her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그렇다면 ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「당신」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:5⟫에게 ⟪k:6⟫시녀 말고 필요한 존재는 없는 "
"것 아니겠는가."

#: badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acae1b87fde9ba48e15eb3093308c619c10b42188babeca9f3a8959073fbf5a6
#. default-sha256: a4860793febdd38a6ccc8ab1464ee927f15d3718151edafe8be7e42c14ffb8d6
msgctxt "badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If she said she wanted to be with ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫시녀가 ⟪k:1⟫「당신」을⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」를⟪k:4⟫ 원한다면……"

#: badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64d92e28461e429b5a139d6b1128c030ca44fd017ad76ad0dfb14bcdee03a973
#. default-sha256: 28957f756f0275382addd4531ed0a28c17c9f650a6aa5a4feed36756a8660bd2
msgctxt "badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ allowed to want the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:4⟫도 시녀를 원해도 되는 것 아니겠는가."

#: badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9de7f90fdd14a028ead6c2a444795fb9b5a8f32de6c06e2de7e7e998dabf9a3
#. default-sha256: d49325d476355af910cbe9cf5bce4d7fac11f3ff26843542cdc762bfec34fe20
msgctxt "badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Grasp my hand, Master...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come, hold it tight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫자, ⟪k:3⟫주인님…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫제 손을…… ⟪k:6⟫잡아 주시어요."

#: badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: caf3c4ff3626766f6af09bd94a755defb97857bbebda0d5f8402908f66d05423
#. default-sha256: 99757593234b654d6f7aa4a1e8902dcce185e6a4f1dc57941adaf6b968aa7871
msgctxt "badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ gently wrapped ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ fingers around the "
"Maid’s cold hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」은⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:4⟫ 시녀의 싸늘한 손을 ⟪k:5⟫살며시 잡았다."

#: badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3baba205bc326344d72d77734fb749b9115ce9181e9e2425bb5533449cd8160c
#. default-sha256: 6997b0e5b130d0b84d62da9cb4dcd3dca34c95f4e1f890c6e39799829208b0cb
msgctxt "badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to let go."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이제…… ⟪k:1⟫이 손이 떨어질 일은 영영 없을 것이다."

#: badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06b9072787d69bbd35cc3c7fa48079c1ab4b615aceb86160f1cc94fc13616240
#. default-sha256: 9c79c53c7bf4a8fb201a7212e591a6124d5c2df580de5ecc2c0473f9552e63d0
msgctxt "badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이제…… ⟪k:1⟫어떠한 것도 떠올리지 않을 것이다."

#: badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1306063bdf1bee6c46aa7c881c58ca27dd5511118cc1a727feac4a53fe2cf054
#. default-sha256: 846a5051ee85c6cecf480c3ee3e52c5ac9b8375fd7ec20c95bb2814293a69c71
msgctxt "badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to look back upon the past ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ might have had,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫과거로 떠내려간 ⟪k:1⟫한 줌 행복의 시간을."

#: badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ed07ca53714b75713945f5c4a3b0061a554ab4016c21624b2970bcc16b74ed7
#. default-sha256: 4aaa13b95ae6ba11dfba57c087dc81c335fa0dc4e07fc6ddf4e3999c6da50dde
msgctxt "badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the rare, treasured days of happiness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫과거로 떠내려간 ⟪k:1⟫고된 흉터의 시간을."

#: badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 913ff8c8722f96e7151aba3a7888f81daf77ee4941854198599c970936ae3850
#. default-sha256: 340f558a474052076939f40d12f075a7151f40d07c572d871c65ad5b9d2277d9
msgctxt "badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the bitter days filled with nothing but pain,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「당신」이⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「죽은 자」가⟪k:5⟫ 찾아내야 했던 이를――"

#: badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea7ae1de3fc3966bccecce73aeb960dc7028e340636680bbe4399e193a2d7334
#. default-sha256: 1a586d322b0f04d2f6c3b5b756c02649202d5e629b4e4e6cad67872f1fb20647
msgctxt "badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the person ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ supposed to find."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫떠올릴 일은 없을 것이다."

#: badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b51c2bfe7223efbfef842261ed0fe47e29daf04e14c8c64ea8b3ca65f090928a
#. default-sha256: d5dd26e691dd89541455c282dd941b4572c84759aad77a4083495237cc3f4b63
msgctxt "badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ fine with that. ⟪k:4⟫There was no one to criticize ⟪k:5⟫"
"You⟪k:6⟫him⟪k:7⟫ for averting ⟪k:8⟫Your⟪k:9⟫his⟪k:10⟫ eyes from ⟪k:11⟫Your⟪k:12⟫his⟪k:13⟫ pain "
"and seizing the opportunity for happiness lying before ⟪k:14⟫You⟪k:15⟫him⟪k:16⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫그래도 된다. ⟪k:2⟫고통을 등지고 ⟪k:3⟫지금 존재하는 행복을 손에 넣으려 하는 "
"⟪k:4⟫「당신」을⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「죽은 자」를⟪k:7⟫ ⟪k:8⟫누가 나무라겠는가."

#: badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaa4c96f51c8c9c7f32831eae09db9111a225f7275e6a303b7f8f44c5906df82
#. default-sha256: 920926eeb99bc355a5c3d91332a152bdeb5b8dd22e7c60116a84c4e6b25e99d4
msgctxt "badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ made the correct choice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」은⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:4⟫ 옳은 선택을 한 것이다……."

#: badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abce39cc54bdc567154b726bfe75da93ad77939c6e2deae8829ba99845029a8d
#. default-sha256: 0cebbf0391fe3ca1eb01a631c53997818a560389e3550e550ffebe5bbecef33e
msgctxt "badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Master... ⟪k:14⟫Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫주인님……, ⟪k:14⟫주인님."

#: badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3d53537e4448f84c14ae20ede01ff81cbe33e0d823662145f8e25817c7e8fff
#. default-sha256: db0139ad06a1396f7dd968998759bff0c6c3c45a3195d07ef7d58fdd78d93fe2
msgctxt "badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, thank goodness. You have awoken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was getting worried there for a moment."
